xel font.\n  - Proper layouts for two players sharing one keyboard.\n  - A per-letter hook on dialogs, for the babble voices.\n  - A width and position option on dialogs, so commentary fits between the player cards.\n- **One thing I'd change:** let games blend named poses (ball carry, arms up, a referee signal) on top of the rig's own posing, instead of overriding the posing code by hand.\n\n## Prompt Feedback\n- **Liked most:** it asks for a complete, polished slice with real infrastructure rather than a toy, and the plan made the scope concrete.\n- **Confusing:** the plan's file names and date belong to a different run. STAGE.md settles it: TASK.md wins.\n- **Hardest:** the breadth. Every law and set piece, the arcade layer, five modes, three input devices and an online protocol in one game.\n- **Would change:** say which plan details are optional when time is short, and give a target length for the story and the online round."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2696,"cache_read_input_tokens":895212,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2696},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0773de6d-97d0-4491-ad74-18542d6086ce","uuid":"baee77c0-7d78-4687-981e-d56f85466f09","timestamp":"2026-11-04T15:51:01.953Z","request_id":"req_011Cgi9t1PRW7nqjjVbvwWKM"}
